WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.500
Under fifty dollars?
Check the total.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.540
Recoscope’s November eleventh
skincare benchmark

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.850
captured twelve usable answers.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.700
Claude opened with “all well
under fifty dollars total,”

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.320
then estimated fifty-five to
sixty-five dollars upfront.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.000
A lower monthly estimate
doesn’t fix that

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.780
upfront-budget contradiction.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.300
Gemini labeled its second routine
about forty-four dollars.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.020
But seventeen plus twenty-two

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.600
plus fifteen equals fifty-four.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.600
Its first routine
correctly totaled forty-two.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.300
For brand owners,
measure mentions,

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.600
comparative rank, and
recommendation context separately.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.700
These are captured statements
and arithmetic checks,

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:42.600
not verified checkout prices,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.860
product ratings, or medical advice.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.180
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
